  "published": "2026-07-27T04:21:33.833Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds CC031: flags blocking synchronization primitives — ManualResetEventSlim.Wait, CountdownEvent.Wait, WaitHandle.WaitOne/WaitAll/WaitAny, Monitor.Wait, Thread.Join — inside async code. These park a thread-pool thread until another thread signals, consuming a pooled thread the awaited continuations may themselves need, and observe no CancellationToken; blocking on cancellationToken.WaitHandle is a common instance. Analyzer-only by design: these primitives have no async counterpart, so the resolution is a design change (SemaphoreSlim.WaitAsync, a TaskCompletionSource, or awaiting the task instead of joining the thread). 31 diagnostics.",
